    },
    "Adds a contrast offset to each RGB channel for both SDR and HDR. Zero keeps the shared Contrast value." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为 SDR 和 HDR 的各 RGB 通道添加对比度偏移。零表示使用共用的对比度值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds an equal offset to linear RGB before tone mapping. Negative values clip shadows; positive values lift black." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在色调映射前为线性 RGB 添加相同的偏移量。负值会裁切阴影，正值会抬高黑位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjacent colors meet at their angular midpoint when rotated fully toward each other." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "相邻颜色各自向对方旋转至极限时，会在两者色相角的中点相遇。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust Contrast until the SDR image looks good, then choose Continue. The HDR extension updates automatically from the SDR curve." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整对比度，直到 SDR 图像效果满意，然后点击“继续”。HDR 延伸部分会根据 SDR 曲线自动更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust white point when you release the Tone slider. The hidden HDR Target follows Tone and Contrast adjustments." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "松开影调滑块时调整白场。隐藏的 HDR 目标值会随影调和对比度更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjusts HDR curvature while preserving the starting tangent. Zero is straight; 100% ends flat; -100% bends upward to nearly twice the straight endpoint. HDR Gain multiplies the result and can be increased if the curves cross." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整 HDR 曲率，同时保持起点切线。0 为直线，100% 在末端变平，-100% 向上弯曲，使峰值接近直线末端的两倍。HDR 增益会缩放结果，曲线相交时可增加增益。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
