    "Log-input LUTs require HDR Gain to be enabled. The fully processed HDR image is used as input, and the LUT produces SDR output. With HDR Gain off, the LUT is bypassed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Log 输入 LUT 需要启用 HDR 增益。LUT 使用完成全部处理的 HDR 图像作为输入，并生成 SDR 输出。关闭 HDR 增益时，将跳过此 LUT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low density" : {
