            "value" : "移动到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Multiplies OKLCH chroma according to input chroma, from 0 to 0.4. Values above 0.4 use the right endpoint. 1× is unchanged; lightness and hue are preserved within the working gamut." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根据输入色度（0 至 0.4）调整 OKLCH 色度倍率。超过 0.4 的值使用右端点。1× 保持不变；在工作色域内保持明度和色相。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Multiplies OKLCH chroma according to input chroma, from 0 to the maximum chroma in the selected SDR color space. HDR values above that maximum use the right endpoint. 1× is unchanged; lightness and hue are preserved within the working gamut." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根据输入色度调整 OKLCH 色度倍率，范围为 0 至所选 SDR 色彩空间的最大色度。超过此值的 HDR 色度使用右端点。1× 保持不变；在工作色域内保持明度和色相。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Multiplies OKLCH chroma according to perceptual lightness, from 0 (black) to 1 (SDR white). HDR lightness above 1 uses the right endpoint. 1× is unchanged." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根据感知明度（0 为黑色，1 为 SDR 白色）调整 OKLCH 色度倍率。HDR 明度超过 1 时使用右端点。1× 保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
