    "Record the effective ISO in exports, taking exposure adjustments into account, rather than the capture ISO." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在导出文件中记录计入曝光调整后的等效 ISO，而非拍摄时的 ISO。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Red" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "红色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Red gain" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "红色增益"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Redistributes contrast across the SDR range. The middle controls lie halfway from black to Tone and from Tone to white. Equal weights leave the original curve unchanged; higher relative weights add contrast locally." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 SDR 范围内重新分配对比度。中间两个控制点分别位于黑色与影调、影调与白色之间的中点。所有权重相等时保持原始曲线不变；相对权重越高，局部对比度越强。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Redistributes contrast toward shadows or highlights without moving the peak set by Tone. Positive values favor the shadow side; negative values favor the highlight side. Zero is unchanged. Skew has no effect at zero Contrast." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在不移动影调所设峰值位置的情况下，将对比度分布偏向暗部或高光。正值偏向暗部，负值偏向高光。零表示不改变。对比度为零时，偏斜不起作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Redo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重做"
