    },
    "The unreadable library was backed up. A new library has been created." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取的资料库已备份，并已创建新的资料库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are unsaved edits for %lld file(s). Save them or discard them before continuing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有 %lld 个文件的编辑尚未保存。请保存或放弃这些编辑后再继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These settings will apply to every photo you open and every export, including batch exports, overriding saved settings where they differ. Any resulting changes remain unsaved until you save them. Consider whether you want to save edits made from this point forward." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些设置将应用于之后打开的每张照片及所有导出（包括批量导出），并覆盖与其不同的已保存设置。产生的更改在您保存前均为未保存状态。请考虑是否要保存从现在起所做的编辑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This development recipe uses an unsupported version or is too large." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此显影设置的版本不受支持，或数据过大。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This image format is not supported by Core Image." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Core Image 不支持此图像格式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This lets you set multipliers to saturation for different levels of input saturation. A traditional “vibrance” slider is equivalent to moving the midpoint in this graph. And a traditional “Saturation” slider is equivalent to moving the right end point of this graph." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此图可为不同输入饱和度设置饱和度倍数。传统的“自然饱和度”滑块相当于移动图中间的控制点，而传统的“饱和度”滑块相当于移动最右端的控制点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
